    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/a9923e77b3c0acc0feba12e07561d076.avif?t=1754564013\" width=1051 height=179 /></span>Restore the world with your hands, your heart, and just a touch of magic. Watch seeds turn into trees and the desert turn into a green oasis. Feel the change as it happens: warm breezes ripple through freshly sprouted meadows, frogs return to singing wetlands, and it finally rains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8c32cd02efc0e9f09688c7c096e8fcd5.poster.avif?t=1754564013\" width=1600 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8c32cd02efc0e9f09688c7c096e8fcd5.webm?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8c32cd02efc0e9f09688c7c096e8fcd5.mp4?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/48866c89a95be2855d0d0b9a2bdee02b.webp?t=1754564013\" width=1051 height=61 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant &amp; Cultivate:</strong> Discover new seeds, choose which animal habitats to restore, learn powerful plant synergies, and create beautiful living biomes according to your vision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle &amp; Craft:</strong> Clean up old junk to collect crafting materials and upcycle them into beautiful decorations for your home, or powerful watering systems for your plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend Folklore Spirits: </strong>Meet mythical nature spirits willing to give you mighty abilities in exchange for your help (and maybe a few shiny objects.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the Fruits of Your Care:\u00a0</strong>Harvest flowers and berries to plant in new areas or to give as gifts to your favourite animals and friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/672f3b1529bcf86b86ac53e1178680ee.poster.avif?t=1754564013\" width=1600 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/672f3b1529bcf86b86ac53e1178680ee.webm?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/672f3b1529bcf86b86ac53e1178680ee.mp4?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/65033684658c91cf8b5887e1c7f333a7.avif?t=1754564013\" width=1051 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Stress-free: no timers, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Feel your impact! Everything you do helps nature recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Rich atmosphere: adaptive soundtrack + ASMR-like nature sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Intuitive mechanics with folklore storytelling.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/a9923e77b3c0acc0feba12e07561d076.avif?t=1754564013\" width=1051 height=179 /></span>Restore the world with your hands, your heart, and just a touch of magic. Watch seeds turn into trees and the desert turn into a green oasis. Feel the change as it happens: warm breezes ripple through freshly sprouted meadows, frogs return to singing wetlands, and it finally rains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8c32cd02efc0e9f09688c7c096e8fcd5.poster.avif?t=1754564013\" width=1600 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8c32cd02efc0e9f09688c7c096e8fcd5.webm?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/8c32cd02efc0e9f09688c7c096e8fcd5.mp4?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/48866c89a95be2855d0d0b9a2bdee02b.webp?t=1754564013\" width=1051 height=61 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant &amp; Cultivate:</strong> Discover new seeds, choose which animal habitats to restore, learn powerful plant synergies, and create beautiful living biomes according to your vision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recycle &amp; Craft:</strong> Clean up old junk to collect crafting materials and upcycle them into beautiful decorations for your home, or powerful watering systems for your plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend Folklore Spirits: </strong>Meet mythical nature spirits willing to give you mighty abilities in exchange for your help (and maybe a few shiny objects.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the Fruits of Your Care:\u00a0</strong>Harvest flowers and berries to plant in new areas or to give as gifts to your favourite animals and friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/672f3b1529bcf86b86ac53e1178680ee.poster.avif?t=1754564013\" width=1600 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/672f3b1529bcf86b86ac53e1178680ee.webm?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/672f3b1529bcf86b86ac53e1178680ee.mp4?t=1754564013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419080/extras/65033684658c91cf8b5887e1c7f333a7.avif?t=1754564013\" width=1051 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Stress-free: no timers, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Feel your impact! Everything you do helps nature recover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Rich atmosphere: adaptive soundtrack + ASMR-like nature sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Intuitive mechanics with folklore storytelling.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Regreening is a cozy simulation game about healing the world. Restore animal habitats, befriend nature spirits, and regrow the wasteland. Upcycle everything and craft your own paradise. Can you transform this deserted world into a joyful home again?",
